  "bald": {"headword": "bald", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 秃头的, 光秃的, 单调的, 赤裸的\nvi. 变秃", "en": "v. grow bald; lose hair on one's head\ns. with no effort to conceal\ns. lacking hair on all or most of the scalp\ns. without the natural or usual covering"},
