  "chocolate": {"headword": "chocolate", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 巧克力\na. 巧克力制的", "en": "n. a food made from roasted ground cacao beans\nn. a medium brown to dark-brown color"},
  "choice": {"headword": "choice", "phonetic": "tʃɒis", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 选择, 精选品, 选择权\na. 精选的, 挑三拣四的, 上等的\n[计] DOS内部命令:在批处理文件中\n该命令用于提示用户作出选择, 决定批处理文件的流程", "en": "n. the person or thing chosen or selected\nn. the act of choosing or selecting\ns. of superior grade\ns. appealing to refined taste"},
