  "confirm": {"headword": "confirm", "pos": "", "zh": "vt. 证实, 确定, 批准, 使巩固\n[计] 确认", "en": "v. establish or strengthen as with new evidence or facts\nv. strengthen or make more firm\nv. make more firm\nv. support a person for a position"},
