  "couch": {"headword": "couch", "phonetic": "kautʃ", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 长沙发, 睡椅, 卧榻\nvt. 横躺, 表达\nvi. 躺下, 蹲伏", "en": "n. a flat coat of paint or varnish used by artists as a primer\nn. a narrow bed on which a patient lies during psychiatric or psychoanalytic treatment"},
