  "curious": {"headword": "curious", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 好奇的, 求知的, 古怪的", "en": "s. beyond or deviating from the usual or expected\na. eager to investigate and learn or learn more (sometimes about others' concerns)\ns. having curiosity aroused; eagerly interested in learning more"},
