  "determine": {"headword": "determine", "pos": "", "zh": "v. 决定, 决心", "en": "v. establish after a calculation, investigation, experiment, survey, or study\nv. shape or influence; give direction to\nv. fix conclusively or authoritatively\nv. fix in scope; fix the boundaries of"},
