  "diamond": {"headword": "diamond", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 钻石, 菱形\n[计] 菱形", "en": "n. a transparent piece of diamond that has been cut and polished and is valued as a precious gem\nn. very hard native crystalline carbon valued as a gem\nn. a playing card in the minor suit that has one or more red rhombuses on it"},
