  "digital": {"headword": "digital", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 数字显示的, 数字的\nn. 数字仪表, 数字式电子表(或时钟)\n[计] 数字, 数字式", "en": "a. displaying numbers rather than scale positions\na. relating to or performed with the fingers\na. of a circuit or device that represents magnitudes in digits"},
