  "dislike": {"headword": "dislike", "phonetic": "dis'laik", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 嫌恶\nvt. 讨厌, 不喜欢", "en": "n. a feeling of aversion or antipathy\nv. have or feel a dislike or distaste for"},
