  "dispose": {"headword": "dispose", "pos": "", "zh": "vt. 处理, 排列, 布置\nvi. 处置", "en": "v. give, sell, or transfer to another\nv. make receptive or willing towards an action or attitude or belief\nv. place or put in a particular order"},
