  "divide": {"headword": "divide", "phonetic": "di'vaid", "pos": "", "zh": "vi. 分开, 分配, 分裂\nvt. 分, 分开, 分裂, 除\nn. 分配, 分水岭\n[计] 除", "en": "n. a serious disagreement between two groups of people (typically producing tension or hostility)\nv. separate into parts or portions\nv. perform a division"},
