  "doom": {"headword": "doom", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 厄运, 不幸, 法律, 宣告, 判决, 死亡\nvt. 命中注定, 判决", "en": "n. an unpleasant or disastrous destiny\nv. make certain of the failure or destruction of"},
