  "frustrate": {"headword": "frustrate", "phonetic": "'frʌstreit", "pos": "", "zh": "vt. 挫败, 击败, 破坏\na. 无益的, 挫败的, 挫折的", "en": "v hinder or prevent (the efforts, plans, or desires) of\nv treat cruelly"},
