  "fulfill": {"headword": "fulfill", "phonetic": "ful'fil", "pos": "", "zh": "vt. 实践, 履行, 实行, 完成, 结束, 满足\n[法] 履行, 完成, 达到", "en": "v put in effect\nv meet the requirements or expectations of\nv fill or meet a want or need"},
  "full": {"headword": "full", "phonetic": "ful", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 全部, 完整\na. 充满的, 完全的, 丰富的, 完美的, 丰满的, 详尽的\nadv. 完全地, 整整, 十分\nvt. 把(衣服等)缝得宽松, 漂洗\n[计] 完整", "en": "v. beat for the purpose of cleaning and thickening\nv. make (a garment) fuller by pleating or gathering\na. containing as much or as many as is possible or normal\ns. complete in extent or degree and in every particular"},
