  "garment": {"headword": "garment", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 衣服, 衣装, 外表", "en": "n. an article of clothing"},
  "gas": {"headword": "gas", "phonetic": "gæs", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 气体, 汽油, 瓦斯\n[化] 气体; 煤气; 瓦斯; 毒气", "en": "n. the state of matter distinguished from the solid and liquid states by: relatively low density and viscosity; relatively great expansion and contraction with changes in pressure and temperature; the ability to diffuse readily; and the spontaneous tendency to become distributed uniformly throughout any container\nn. a fluid in the gaseous state having neither independent shape nor volume and being able to expand indefinitely\nv. attack with gas; subject to gas fumes"},
