  "junk": {"headword": "junk", "phonetic": "dʒʌŋk", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 垃圾, 乌七八糟的东西, 舢板\n[计] 清除", "en": "n. any of various Chinese boats with a high poop and lugsails"},
