  "just": {"headword": "just", "phonetic": "dʒʌst", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 正直的, 合理的, 正确的, 应得的\nadv. 刚刚, 正好, 仅仅", "en": "a. used especially of what is legally or ethically right or proper or fitting\nr. only a moment ago\nr. absolutely\nr. exactly at this moment or the moment described;"},
