  "lamb": {"headword": "lamb", "phonetic": "læm", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 小羊, 羔羊\nv. 产羊羔", "en": "n. young sheep\nn. English essayist (1775-1834)\nn. a person easily deceived or cheated (especially in financial matters)\nn. a sweet innocent mild-mannered person (especially a child)"},
  "lame": {"headword": "lame", "phonetic": "leim", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 跛足的, 僵痛的, 不完全的, 金属薄板, 不知内情的人\nvi. 变跛\nvt. 使成残废, 使无用", "en": "n. a fabric interwoven with threads of metal"},
