  "lavatory": {"headword": "lavatory", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 洗脸盆, 厕所", "en": "n a room or building equipped with one or more toilets\nn a bathroom sink that is permanently installed and connected to a water supply and drainpipe; where you can wash your hands and face\nn a toilet that is cleaned of waste by the flow of water through it"},
