  "lay": {"headword": "lay", "phonetic": "lei", "pos": "", "zh": "vt. 放置, 产, 铺设, 布置, 提出, 平息\nvi. 下蛋, 打赌\nn. 位置, 层, 隐藏处\na. 世俗的, 外行的\nlie的过去式", "en": "v. put in a horizontal position\nv. prepare or position for action or operation\nv. lay eggs\nv. impose as a duty, burden, or punishment"},
