  "leaf": {"headword": "leaf", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 叶, 树叶, 花瓣, 页\nvi. 生叶, 翻书页\nvt. 在...上长叶, 翻...的页", "en": "n. the main organ of photosynthesis and transpiration in higher plants\nn. a sheet of any written or printed material (especially in a manuscript or book)\nn. hinged or detachable flat section (as of a table or door)\nv. turn over pages"},
  "leaflet": {"headword": "leaflet", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 小叶, 传单\n[医] 小叶", "en": "n. part of a compound leaf"},
  "league": {"headword": "league", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 同盟, 联盟, 盟约\nv. 组联盟, (使)加盟", "en": "n. an association of sports teams that organizes matches for its members\nn. an association of states or organizations or individuals for common action\nn. an obsolete unit of distance of variable length (usually 3 miles)\nv. unite to form a league"},
  "leak": {"headword": "leak", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 漏洞, 漏处, 漏出, 泄漏\nvi. 漏, 泄漏\nvt. 使渗漏", "en": "n. an accidental hole that allows something (fluid or light etc.) to enter or escape\nn. soft watery rot in fruits and vegetables caused by fungi\nn. a euphemism for urination\nn. unauthorized (especially deliberate) disclosure of confidential information"},
  "lean": {"headword": "lean", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 瘦肉, 倾斜, 倾斜度\na. 瘦的, 贫乏的, 歉收的\nvi. 倚靠, 倾斜, 依赖\nvt. 使倾斜", "en": "v. to incline or bend from a vertical position\nv. cause to lean or incline\nv. rely on for support\na. lacking in mineral content or combustible material"},
  "leap": {"headword": "leap", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 跳跃, 剧增, 急变, 被越过之物\nvi. 跳跃, 突然经过\nvt. 跃过, 使跃过", "en": "n. a light, self-propelled movement upwards or forwards\nn. an abrupt transition\nn. the distance leaped (or to be leaped)\nv. pass abruptly from one state or topic to another"},
  "learn": {"headword": "learn", "pos": "", "zh": "vt. 学习；认识到；得知", "en": "v. gain knowledge or skills\nv. get to know or become aware of, usually accidentally\nv. be a student of a certain subject"},
  "learned": {"headword": "learned", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 有学问的, 学术上的\nlearn的过去式和过去分词", "en": "v gain knowledge or skills\nv get to know or become aware of, usually accidentally\nv commit to memory; learn by heart\nv be a student of a certain subject\nv impart skills or knowledge to\nv find out, learn, or determine with certainty, usually by making an inquiry or other effort\ns having or showing profound knowledge\ns highly educated; having extensive information or understanding\na established by conditioning or learning"},
  "learning": {"headword": "learning", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 学问, 学识, 学习\n[计] 学习", "en": "n. the cognitive process of acquiring skill or knowledge"},
  "lease": {"headword": "lease", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 租约, 租期, 租\nvt. 出租, 租出, 租得", "en": "n. property that is leased or rented out or let\nn. a contract granting use or occupation of property during a specified time for a specified payment\nn. the period of time during which a contract conveying property to a person is in effect\nv. grant use or occupation of under a term of contract"},
  "least": {"headword": "least", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 最少, 最小, 最小限度\na. 最少的, 最小的\nadv. 最小, 最少", "en": "n. something that is of no importance\na. the superlative of `little' that can be used with mass nouns and is usually preceded by `the'; a quantifier meaning smallest in amount or extent or degree\nr. used to form the superlative"},
  "leather": {"headword": "leather", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 皮革, 皮制品, 马镫的皮带\nvt. 覆以皮革, 鞭苔, 抽打\na. 皮革的, 皮制的", "en": "n. an animal skin made smooth and flexible by removing the hair and then tanning\nv. whip with a leather strap"},
  "leave": {"headword": "leave", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 许可, 告别, 请假, 休假\nvt. 离开, 剩下, 遗忘, 委托, 丢弃\nvi. 出发, 离开, 生叶", "en": "n. the period of time during which you are absent from work or duty\nn. permission to do something\nv. go away from a place\nv. go and leave behind, either intentionally or by neglect or forgetfulness"},
  "lecture": {"headword": "lecture", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 演讲, 谴责, 讲稿\nvt. 演讲, 训诫, 说教\nvi. 讲演", "en": "n. a speech that is open to the public\nn. a lengthy rebuke\nn. teaching by giving a discourse on some subject (typically to a class)\nv. deliver a lecture or talk"},
  "left": {"headword": "left", "phonetic": "left", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 左边的, 左倾的, 左侧的, 左派的\nadv. 在左面\nn. 左, 左面, 左派\nleave的过去式和过去分词", "en": "n. location near or direction toward the left side; i.e. the side to the north when a person or object faces east\nn. those who support varying degrees of social or political or economic change designed to promote the public welfare\nn. the hand that is on the left side of the body\nn. a turn toward the side of the body that is on the north when the person is facing east"},
  "leftover": {"headword": "leftover", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 剩货, 残留物, 剩饭\na. 残余的", "en": "n. a small part or portion that remains after the main part no longer exists\ns. not used up"},
  "leg": {"headword": "leg", "phonetic": "leg", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 腿, 假腿, 路程\nvi. 走, 跑", "en": "n. a human limb; commonly used to refer to a whole limb but technically only the part of the limb between the knee and ankle\nn. a structure in animals that is similar to a human leg and used for locomotion\nn. one of the supports for a piece of furniture\nn. the limb of an animal used for food"},
  "legacy": {"headword": "legacy", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 祖先传下来之物, 遗赠物\n[经] 遗产, 遗赠物", "en": "n (law) a gift of personal property by will"},
  "legal": {"headword": "legal", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 法律的, 法定的, 合法的\n[经] 法定权利; 法律(上)的, 合法的", "en": "a. established by or founded upon law or official or accepted rules\na. of or relating to jurisprudence\ns. having legal efficacy or force\na. relating to or characteristic of the profession of law"},
  "legally": {"headword": "legally", "pos": "", "zh": "adv. 法律上, 合法地\n[法] 法律上, 合法地, 法定地", "en": "r. by law; conforming to the law\nr. in a legal manner"},
  "legend": {"headword": "legend", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 传说, 传奇文学, 图例\n[计] 图例", "en": "n. a story about mythical or supernatural beings or events"},
  "legislation": {"headword": "legislation", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 立法, 法律\n[医] 立法, 法规", "en": "n. law enacted by a legislative body\nn. the act of making or enacting laws"},
  "legislature": {"headword": "legislature", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 立法机关, 议会, 立法院\n[法] 立法机构, 立法机关", "en": "n. persons who make or amend or repeal laws"},
  "legitimate": {"headword": "legitimate", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 合法的, 正当的, 婚生的\nvt. 认为正当, 立为嫡嗣, 使合法", "en": "v. show or affirm to be just and legitimate\nv. make (an illegitimate child) legitimate; declare the legitimacy of (someone)\na. of marriages and offspring; recognized as lawful\ns. based on known statements or events or conditions"},
  "leisure": {"headword": "leisure", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 空闲, 闲暇, 悠闲\na. 空闲的, 有闲的", "en": "n. time available for ease and relaxation\nn. freedom to choose a pastime or enjoyable activity"},
