  "level": {"headword": "level", "phonetic": "'levl", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 水平, 水准, 平地\na. 同高的, 平坦的, 齐平的, 水平的\nvt. 弄平, 夷平, 使同等, 瞄准, 对准\nvi. 变平, 拉平\n[计] 级别", "en": "n. height above ground\nn. indicator that establishes the horizontal when a bubble is centered in a tube of liquid\nn. an abstract place usually conceived as having depth\nv. aim at"},
  "lever": {"headword": "lever", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 杠杆, 似杠杆之工具\nvt. 撬开\nvi. 使用杠杆", "en": "n. a rigid bar pivoted about a fulcrum\nn. a simple machine that gives a mechanical advantage when given a fulcrum\nn. a flat metal tumbler in a lever lock"},
