  "majority": {"headword": "majority", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 多数, 大半\n[计] 多数逻辑", "en": "n. the property resulting from being or relating to the greater in number of two parts; the main part\nn. (elections) more than half of the votes\nn. the age at which persons are considered competent to manage their own affairs"},
