  "mania": {"headword": "mania", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 狂躁, 热衷, 狂热\n[医] 躁狂, 狂", "en": "n. an irrational but irresistible motive for a belief or action\nn. a mood disorder; an affective disorder in which the victim tends to respond excessively and sometimes violently"},
