  "mouth": {"headword": "mouth", "phonetic": "mauθ", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 嘴, 口, 口腔, 口状物\nvi. 装腔作势说话, 做鬼脸\nvt. 说出, 做作地说", "en": "n. the opening through which food is taken in and vocalizations emerge\nn. the externally visible part of the oral cavity on the face and the system of organs surrounding the opening\nn. an opening that resembles a mouth (as of a cave or a gorge)\nn. the point where a stream issues into a larger body of water"},
  "mouthpiece": {"headword": "mouthpiece", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 发话筒, 代言人, (电话)送话口\n[机] 钳口垫片", "en": "n. a part that goes over or into the mouth of a person\nn. an acoustic device; the part of a telephone into which a person speaks\nn. a spokesperson (as a lawyer)\nn. (especially boxing) equipment that protects an athlete's mouth"},
