  "rather": {"headword": "rather", "pos": "", "zh": "adv. 宁可, 稍微, 相当", "en": "r. on the contrary; rather (or instead), he wrote her a letter\"\nr. to some (great or small) extent"},
  "ratio": {"headword": "ratio", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 比, 比率\n[医] 比, 比率, 比例", "en": "n. the relative magnitudes of two quantities (usually expressed as a quotient)"},
  "rational": {"headword": "rational", "pos": "", "zh": "a. 理性的, 合理的\nn. 有理数", "en": "a. consistent with or based on or using reason\na. capable of being expressed as a quotient of integers\ns. having its source in or being guided by the intellect (as distinguished from experience or emotion)"},
