  "sand": {"headword": "sand", "phonetic": "sænd", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 沙, 沙子, 沙滩, 光阴, 生涯\nvt. 撒沙, 以沙掩盖", "en": "n. a loose material consisting of grains of rock or coral\nn. French writer known for works concerning women's rights and independence (1804-1876)"},
