  "save": {"headword": "save", "phonetic": "seiv", "pos": "", "zh": "n. 救球\nvt. 解救, 挽救, 储蓄, 保存, 节省, 保留\nvi. 挽救, 节省, 救球\nprep. 除...之外\n[计] 保存", "en": "n. (sports) the act of preventing the opposition from scoring\nv. to keep up and reserve for personal or special use\nv. bring into safety\nv. spend less; buy at a reduced price"},
